  "closed_3c": "Boolean full quotient PSD is the existing Mobius nonnegative-type criterion under invertible change of basis; four explicit pairs closed, no new task/edge. Truncated flat theorem preserved as prospective tool only, with precise high-order boundary.",
  "actual_root_math": [
    "CA65: 20delta=L from ordered off-diagonal sum; only specified-lift ten comparisons and four negative categories count toward target, universal fixed-projection exclusion stays an additional corollary.",
    "Flat: ordinary Hankel pullback, delta=0 iff same-rank, positive Boolean atom law and affine isolation pay original T for every atom; HS is support count, rational projection splitting is polynomial in explicit bit input.",
    "MILP: one T_k is maximum of all selected credible children values; selected actual action lies above this shared threshold. Exact original T[k] construction and all constraints agree.",
    "WC frontier: convex right-endpoint triangular sums plus B*c(B) baseline give W/(d+1)<=Phi_hat<=W; this needs a precise application relation rather than treating stability-only background absorption as a whole welfare theorem.",
    "Two-person: H=W+u/2 and K=2L+u/2 imply 5W/4 by 3:1 convex combination, with no L<=W/2 premise. Existing canonical ordinary-and-terminal-br-min has exactly this K and the same per-client slack, followed by background-to-root-sharp. This is a resolved duplicate comparison, not a new independent proof edge.",
    "Flow: complete ordered IC plus same-topic monotone graph gives W>=n v_n under H_root; the independent static minimax remainder gives OPT+R<=(2n-1)v_n. Fixed n>=2 follows, n=1 is direct BR. Q_fl and Q_st* need not coincide; no root-to-all-background upgrade.",
    "Flow obstacle scope: same sigma and true optimal pi are required for a Farkas separator. The 34-customer unique pi=(10,10,21,10,10,21)/82 yields positive saved weak/strong gaps102501/41 and307503/41; DR161/fullslot violate required same-topic arcs. These inspected obstacles do not refute H_root; no universal feasibility or customer counterexample absence is inferred."
  ],
